  topic: Instructional Excellence Pillar Details (Angela Atkinson Duina)
  desc: The Superintendent elaborated on the Instructional Excellence pillar, focusing
    on multi-tiered systems of support (MTSS), positive behavioral interventions and
    supports (PBIS), and engaging instruction. A key numerical goal is to reduce chronic
    student absenteeism by an additional 5%, aiming to decrease the current 21% rate.
